    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sligo Estates are pleased to bring to the market this Spacious 4 Bedroom semi-detached residence. The property is located in much sought after residential area within walking distance of Sligo City center & bus route. It is extremely convenient to all family amenities, Schools, Sport facilities, shops etc.\r\nFeatures include oil fired central heating, double glazing.\r\nIdeal Family home in safe location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\n\r\n4.99m x 2.13m, Tiled floor, radiator, 1 p.p. telephone point, Smoke alarm, lockup alarm.\r\n\r\n\r\nSitting room:\r\n\r\n5.74m x 3.97m, Open fire with back boiler, built in units, pine floor, Radiator, 5 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\n\r\n6.23m x 3.8m, Fitted kitchen units, pine floor, 9 p.p. radiator, patio Door to rear.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room:\r\n\r\n2.39m x 1.48m, Plumbed for washing machine, dryer, 4 p.p, Indoor oil boiler, electric trip/fuse board, Door to rear.\r\n\r\n\r\nW.C. W.C. Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding:\r\n\r\n2.46m x 1.89m, Fitted carpet, storage press, hot press with Immersion, access to attic.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\n\r\n2.7m x 3.1m, Fitted carpet, built in wardrobe, radiator, 2 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n\r\n3.4m x 4.34m, Pine floor, built in wardrobe, radiator, 4 p.p.\r\nEn-Suite: W.C. wash hand basin, Shower with door, power shower.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\n\r\n2.67m x 3.4m, Fitted carpet, radiator, 2 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\r\n\r\n2.7m x 3.1m, Pine floor, built in wardrobe, radiator, 2 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n\r\n2.4m x 2.32m, W.C. wash hand basin, fully tiled.\r\n\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n\r\nAll mains, Oil Fired Central Heating, teak double glazing.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\n\r\nGood size Landscaped gardens front & rear, Tarmac driveway.\r\n\r\n\r\nRefurbishment Grant Scheme maybe available.\r\nSubject to purchasers own eligibility/ Risk.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing:\r\n\r\nStrictly by Appointment with Sligo Estates.\r\n\r\nAUCTIONEER HANDLING SALE:\r\n\r\nContact:\r\nGreg Kelly MSCSI, Assoc. MRICS,\r\nFrances Kelly I.P.A.V.\r\nTelephone: (071) 914 3425 / 0876242470."
      },
